    "title": "Ramp Debuts AR Tool to Keep Finance Teams From Chasing Payments",
    "summary": "Ramp has introduced a tool designed to automate invoicing and payment collections for corporate clients. Ramp Accounts Receivable, announced Tuesday (Sept. 22), allows the FinTech’s clients to use Ramp to manage both costs and revenue. “This has been a top request from our customers,” Geoff Charles, chief product officer at Ramp, said in a news release. “Finance teams […]\nThe post Ramp Debuts AR Tool to Keep Finance Teams From Chasing Payments appeared first on PYMNTS.com.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.pymnts.com/back-office/accounts-receivable/2026/ramp-debuts-ar-tool-to-keep-finance-teams-from-chasing-payments/",
